        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-modifier-order-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Build a clear noun phrase",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put possession, pointing and quantity before the main noun, with a description close to that noun. Prefer a clear short phrase to piling up descriptions.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我的这两本新书",
                "pinyin": "wǒ de zhè liǎng běn xīn shū",
                "meaning": "these two new books of mine",
                "audio": "656d5a920757f62b24630266dea94812ceeac196643ed373b6f04a163ba3581b"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
